{
  "name": "n8n 呼叫 Telegram 發送訊息（排程推播與格式化通知）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✈️ 範例 2：n8n 節點發送 Telegram 訊息\n\n1. **Schedule Trigger**：定時觸發（例如每天早上 08:30）或手動點擊執行。\n2. **Edit Fields (Set)**：設定目標 Chat ID、警報等級、報表內容與連結。\n3. **Telegram 節點**：使用 Markdown 排版並附加 Inline Keyboard 互動按鈕發送推播。",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        140
      ],
      "id": "telegram-send-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -160,
        380
      ],
      "id": "schedule-trigger-node",
      "name": "定時排程觸發器"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "set-chat-id",
              "name": "targetChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-server-name",
              "name": "serverName",
              "value": "PROD-APP-SERVER-01",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-status",
              "name": "serverStatus",
              "value": "正常運行中 (Healthy)",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-cpu",
              "name": "cpuUsage",
              "value": "24.5%",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-memory",
              "name": "memoryUsage",
              "value": "3.8 GB / 8.0 GB (47.5%)",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-disk",
              "name": "diskUsage",
              "value": "62.1%",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-alert-level",
              "name": "alertLevel",
              "value": "🟢 INFO",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        100,
        380
      ],
      "id": "prepare-notification-data",
      "name": "準備推播報表資料"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.targetChatId }}",
        "text": "=*📊 系統日常維運監控日報*\n\n等級：`{{ $json.alertLevel }}`\n主機名稱：*{{ $json.serverName }}*\n運行狀態：*{{ $json.serverStatus }}*\n\n*資源監控指標：*\n• 💻 *CPU 使用率*：`{{ $json.cpuUsage }}`\n• 🧠 *記憶體佔用*：`{{ $json.memoryUsage }}`\n• 💾 *硬碟空間*：`{{ $json.diskUsage }}`\n\n🕒 報告產生時間：_{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}_",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "🌐 前往監控儀表板",
                  "url": "https://grafana.example.com"
                },
                {
                  "text": "📜 查看伺服器日誌",
                  "url": "https://logs.example.com"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        360,
        380
      ],
      "id": "send-telegram-push-message",
      "name": "發送 Telegram Markdown 推播訊息",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "定時排程觸發器": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "準備推播報表資料",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "準備推播報表資料": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "發送 Telegram Markdown 推播訊息",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {}
}